    "text": "WRAL\nwebsite\nDurham\nDuke Health event in Durham responds to rising need for caregiver support in NC\nBy Grace Hayba, WRAL health reporter,\n6 hours agoNorth Carolina is growing older, and with that comes a need for more caregivers. Data from NCDHHS shows the state is projected to have more than 16,800 people living over the age of 100 by 2050, a 273% increase from 2024. Duke Health’s annual caregiver event in Durham works to...\n7",
